        "json": "# Ghost NIC Hunter\n\n**Latest successful scan per VM.** History retains every structured result, including cleaned VMs. Removal totals include reported candidate removals even when final safety validation aborts; safety aborts remain identified separately. Data can arrive a few minutes after the Automation job completes."
